hwui's HintSessionWrapper includes <memory> for its std::shared_ptr (ADR-0043 a1).

HintSessionWrapper.h uses std::shared_ptr and std::make_shared but includes only <future>, <optional> and <vector>.
Android 15's libc++ brought <memory> along; the NDK's newer one, at hwui's C++ standard (gnu++2b), no longer
includes it through <future>.

--- a/frameworks/base/libs/hwui/renderthread/HintSessionWrapper.h
+++ b/frameworks/base/libs/hwui/renderthread/HintSessionWrapper.h
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 #include <private/performance_hint_private.h>
 
 #include <future>
+#include <memory>
 #include <optional>
 #include <vector>
 
